IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `paa-grants`

-- Probate and Administration Act 1934, ss 4-6, 13(2), 21, 22, 28, 29, 33, 42, 55, 56(2), 57(4), 62-64, 66 and Second Schedule -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_probate-and-administration-act-1934.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

